{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23758","headline":"见殷尧藩侍御忆江南诗三十首诗中多叙苏杭胜事余尝典二郡因继和之 · 白居易","name":"见殷尧藩侍御忆江南诗三十首诗中多叙苏杭胜事余尝典二郡因继和之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江南名郡数苏杭，写在殷家三十章。\n君是旅人犹苦忆，我爲刺史更难忘。\n境牵吟咏真诗国，兴入笙歌好醉乡。\n爲念旧游终一去，扁舟直拟到沧浪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23758.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23758","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}